--- !u!114 &632198959
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 632198958}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 37171f0ed2d9d3f49b2194e5c650a179, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1015942913}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 2119094118}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 738279116}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 2082515947}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Elana, can I ask you a few questions?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: Sure, what do you want to know?
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: How long have you been serving in this mansion?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "I\u2019ve been serving here for about five years."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Five years, huh? That's relatively new. What kind of family do you serve?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: " I serve the family of Jonathan Hayes. There are three members\u2014Mr.
      and Mrs. Hayes, and Milady."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "(thinking) Milady... what\u2019s her real name? I\u2019m curious about
      that."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: So, what can you tell me about the family?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "They\u2019re a very wealthy family, known for collecting all sorts of
      treasures, like antiques and rare artifacts. People are in awe of their fortune."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Wow, that\u2019s impressive. But\u2026 can I ask why there was a murder
      here in the mansion?"
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "What? Murder? There\u2019s no such thing in this place. You must be mistaken,
      Hazil."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: What?! (thinking) No murder? What does she mean? I need to keep quiet about
      this.
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "Please don\u2019t make such accusations. If you continue with that kind
      of talk, I\u2019ll get really upset."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "I\u2019m sorry! I was just curious because there are so many rumors."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "I\u2019ll forgive you this time, but don\u2019t make that mistake again.
      Hmph."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Okay, got it!
