  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Is this word some sort of hint to open the safe box?
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "Hmm... It seems like it. But I think we should give it a try\u2014maybe
      there\u2019s some treasure inside."
  - speaker: Elana
    line: "And if we can\u2019t open it, that\u2019s alright too. We can always move
      on to the next floor."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Well... if there is treasure, that wouldn\u2019t be so bad. As long as
      we stay focused on finding our objective, we\u2019ll be fine."
